{"catch":"和布娃娃人一起打保齡球","desc":"化身保齡球，在無盡的障礙球道上橫衝直撞，一路捲起那些拼命掙扎的布娃娃般的人類。\n\n躲避碾壓式的危險、旋轉陷阱和殘酷的障礙，它們會毫不留情地摧毀你辛苦收集的人類。遊戲節奏和壓力會不斷升級，考驗你的反應速度和操控技巧。\n\n每輪結束後，將你收集的人類像活體砲彈一樣發射出去，射向高聳的保齡球瓶。盡可能擊倒它們——尤其是保齡球道上最有價值的目標——“國王瓶”。","publisher":"Entity3","release":"2026-02-19","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6db2f68a9e9265a46beffa0afc9e99071bb7505d3d640e2ebc9ccf2a9db8ec67.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2e10ddee678ea61a0c797eddadd40494c9cc7dec128b5fccc5ce3b55acc396c6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ef6e89da49dfddad20f2c870d1a08309903025b6adb60a5618a8bf78e9cc41d7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d8cf0caadf523b4e08ed1e207bf82fc145fdff826cef359f533dc82350ccabd7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d182ca7d455bd84a71da2000f621a20537d6a8a493a8d724147cdf007506c5e0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0d3da5caf9b97cda3dfa9b64098e8306dd92c95b12ddaef700a371e153251df0.jpg"]}